"db0b31a3-7daa-5392-8322-14849f45dd87"] [:db/add "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4" :answer-field/choices "2463d2ff-4dbd-51c4-8130-0067baf72308"] [:db/add "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4" :answer-field/choices "67c36ad3-5889-5449-9def-5de26d3e08c5"] [:db/add "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4" :answer-field/choices "1220a5fe-b919-589d-acd6-205256be7c98"] [:db/add "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4" :answer-field/choices "9b1944f8-7180-54ba-b00c-86c0ecf3f691"] [:db/add "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4" :answer-field/correct "db0b31a3-7daa-5392-8322-14849f45dd87"] [:db/ensure "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c" :question/id #uuid "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c"] [:db/add "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c" :question/problem "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{4\\sin\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\right)}{\\cos\\left(\\frac{6\\pi}{7}\\right)}\n$$"] [:db/add "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c" :question/worked-solution "Put $x=\\frac{3\\pi}{7}$. Recall $2\\sin x\\cos x=\\sin(2x)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{4\\sin x\\cos x}{\\cos(2x)} &=2\\frac{2\\sin x\\cos x}{\\cos(2x)} \\\\ &=2\\frac{\\sin(2x)}{\\cos(2x)} \\\\ &=2\\tan(2x)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe denominator is nonzero, and $\\tan(2x)=\\sin(2x)/\\cos(2x)$.\n\nSubstitute $x=\\frac{3\\pi}{7}$ and double the whole angle: $2x=\\frac{6\\pi}{7}$. The result is\n\n$$\n2\\tan\\left(\\frac{6\\pi}{7}\\right) .\n$$"] [:db/add "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c" :question/answer-fields "8ea01dbb-2723-5ec0-add8-54a4511323f4"] [:db/ensure "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059671 :knowledge-point/questions "8854730c-c3da-5f60-9589-440fbe88c48c"] [:db/add "0e73a38b-e860-5053-b3b7-e57ac1f16749" :answer/id #uuid "0e73a38b-e860-5053-b3b7-e57ac1f16749"] [:db/add