6bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/choices "a1bc3e0e-878a-5bbf-8b06-80052d569d11"] [:db/add "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/choices "794d38f2-4bc3-58c2-ad67-5325d4099b79"] [:db/add "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/choices "7ebf71aa-3017-5625-8a1c-d778d5d0acb5"] [:db/add "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/choices "c4a22465-70b6-5753-ac8c-ad1979008c54"] [:db/add "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/choices "88b10ed2-e752-5ea1-9556-87af34c65799"] [:db/add "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/correct "c4a22465-70b6-5753-ac8c-ad1979008c54"] [:db/ensure "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0" :question/id #uuid "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0"] [:db/add "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0" :question/problem "Simplify.\n\n$$\n\\frac{-\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{11}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{11}\\right)}{2\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{11}\\right)}\n$$"] [:db/add "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0" :question/worked-solution "Put $x=\\frac{\\pi}{11}$. Recall $2\\sin x\\cos x=\\sin(2x)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{-\\sin x\\cos x}{2\\cos(2x)} &=-\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{2\\sin x\\cos x}{\\cos(2x)} \\\\ &=-\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{\\sin(2x)}{\\cos(2x)} \\\\ &=-\\frac{1}{4}\\tan(2x)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe denominator is nonzero, and $\\tan(2x)=\\sin(2x)/\\cos(2x)$.\n\nSubstitute $x=\\frac{\\pi}{11}$ and double the whole angle: $2x=\\frac{2\\pi}{11}$. The result is\n\n$$\n-\\frac{1}{4}\\tan\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{11}\\right) .\n$$"] [:db/add "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0" :question/answer-fields "1796bc82-2001-5240-82ff-da958643b215"] [:db/ensure "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059671 :knowledge-point/questions "b8ab92c5-c09a-56c2-b182-2c7076557cd0"] [:db/ad